  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MPISY (Modernizing Public Institutions and Systems in Yemen)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project strengthens Yemen&#x2019;s core public administration systems, focusing on official statistics, public financial management, HRM/payroll systems, and institutional capacity. Output 1 covers strengthening the statistical system, System of National Accounts, PFM, and HRM/payroll functions. Output 2 covers project management, coordination, change management, and readiness for localization. The project supports transparency, accountability, evidence-based policymaking, and stronger foundations</narrative>
  </description>
